
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Mayank Yadav | Portfolio</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #101010;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    nav {
      padding: 25px;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 65px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 64px);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
      color: #bbbbbb;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 110px 20px;
    }

    .highlight {
      color: #ff8533;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      background: #ff8533;
      color: #111;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .cards {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #202020;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      width: 250px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px;
      background: #181818;
      color: #aaa;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>MY PORTFOLIO.</nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Hello, I'm <span class="highlight">
      Mayank Yadav
    </span></h1>

    <h2>AI Assistant & Graphic Designer</h2>

    <p>
      I create AI advertisements, product visuals,
      graphic designs and creative digital experiences.
    </p>

    <a href="#work" class="btn">Explore My Work</a>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a creative professional combining
      artificial intelligence and graphic design
      to create impactful visual experiences.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="work">
    <h2>What I Do</h2>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">AI Advertisements</div>
      <div class="card">Graphic Design</div>
      <div class="card">AI Product Photoshoots</div>
      <div class="card">Video Editing</div>
      <div class="card">Brand Identity</div>
      <div class="card">Prompt Engineering</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Let's Work Together</h2>

    <p>Have a creative project in mind?</p>

    <a class="btn"
       href="mailto:mayankcreation3@gmail.com">
       Contact Me
    </a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Mayank Yadav. All Rights Reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
